SUMMARY:Free SDoL winter sports physical
DESCRIPTION:SDoL provides free physicals to student-athletes prior to the start of competition each sports season. Any student who is in grade 7 through 12 who plan to participate in a sport during the year must have a physical. When appropriate\, transportation is provided to the site where physicals are offered. \nStudent-athletes must bring a signed copy of the PIAA Physical Form (download below). Sections 1-5 must be completed fully. \nWe will accept walk-ins until 6:30 p.m.\, but those with an appointment will be given priority. \n3:15 p.m. – 5:00 p.m. @ McCaskey High School – East  \nBuses are available for all SDoL students wanting to play a sport during the school year. For the bus schedule\, download the flyer below. \nClick here to download flyer (English) | Español  \nSIGN UP HERE 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/free-sdol-winter-sports-physical/
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
