SUMMARY:SDoL Special Education Paraprofessional Hiring Event
DESCRIPTION:  \nHelp students succeed as a special education paraprofessional with the School District of Lancaster. In this role\, you’ll work alongside educators to support students’ learning and participation throughout the school day. \nJoin us Tuesday\, Nov. 10\, from 3:30 to 5:30 p.m. at Milestones\, 600 Rockland St.\, Lancaster\, for our hiring event. Learn about available positions and apply and interview on-site. \nA résumé is helpful but not required. Please bring contact information for two to three references. \nReady to get started? You don’t have to wait for the event. \nAPPLY HERE
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/sdol-special-education-paraprofessional-hiring-event/
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
